---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Services | Sites By Andrew" description="Website design and practical digital support for local cleaning businesses.">
	<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[78rem] px-5 pb-16 pt-8 sm:px-8 sm:pt-14 lg:px-10 lg:pb-24"><div class="max-w-[52rem]"><p class="mb-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue">Practical help, without the agency maze</p><h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(3.25rem,8vw,7rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.075em]">A better website should make the next step obvious.</h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-[40rem] text-lg leading-8 text-ink-soft sm:text-xl">Clear website design and focused digital help for local cleaning companies. Start with the part that is getting in your way.</p></div>
	<div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 border-t border-line pt-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white/70 p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue">01 / Website</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">A credible front door</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-soft">A focused website that explains what you do, where you work, and how a customer can request a quote.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white/70 p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue">02 / Local visibility</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Be easier to find</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-soft">Make your service area and key information clear across the places local customers look.</p></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white/70 p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue">03 / Practical support</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Keep it working</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink-soft">Straightforward help with updates and next steps, without adding unnecessary complexity.</p></article></div></section>
	<section class="mx-5 mb-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-ink px-6 py-10 text-paper sm:mx-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-14 lg:mx-auto lg:max-w-[76rem] lg:px-16"><div class="max-w-[40rem]"><p class="mb-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-citrus">Start with a conversation</p><h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-5xl">Tell me what needs to be easier.</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-paper/75">A short note is enough to get the conversation started.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-citrus px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-ink transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/contact">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
